WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:06.526
Begin with a single drop.

2
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:09.860
Ink never moves the same way twice.

3
00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:13.984
It opens, slowly, like a flower under water.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.238
Then it lets go, and becomes mist.

5
00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:26.450
Far mountains need almost no ink at all. The
paper does the rest.

6
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:31.938
A crane crosses. No one asks where it is
going.

7
00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:42.090
Last, the circle. One breath. One stroke.

8
00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:48.407
It does not need to be perfect. Only
finished.
